  ["May the God of <Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">Rabbits</><Delete id=\"#158\">Bibi Coins</> bless me. This believer vows to eat <Delete id=\"#158\">books</> vegetables for life and only <Delete id=\"#158\">forgets</> hopes that You will forgive my sins.\nI will use white <Delete id=\"#158\">pull</> candles and <Delete id=\"#158\">worship</> arrange the altar in the shape of a rabbit, never forgetting the eyes and <Delete id=\"#158\">compare</> nose in the center of the circle!"] = "Que o Deus dos <Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\"> Coelhos </> <Delete id=\"#158\"> Bibi Coins </> me abençoe. Este crente jura comer <Delete id=\"#158\"> livros </> vegetais para o resto da vida e apenas <Delete id=\"#158\"> esquece </> espera que Tu perdoes os meus pecados.\nVou usar <Delete id=\"#158\"> velas brancas e <Delete id=\"#158\"> adorar </> arranjar o altar em forma de coelho, nunca esquecendo os olhos e <Delete id=\"#158\"> comparar </> o nariz no centro do círculo!</>",
