  ["<HighLight>%s</>, the purple aura comes from the east, %s has reshaped and obtained the blessing <HighLight>%s</>; truly, others are envious!"] = "<HighLight> %s </> , a aura roxa vem do leste, %s remodelou e obteve a bênção <HighLight> %s </> ; na verdade, outros têm inveja!",
