  ["\"Ladies' Aesthetics\" (Issues No. 6 to 11, Omnibus Edition)　　Subscriber: Christine\n\n\"The Jet-Black Butler\" Hardcover Collector's Edition 　　Subscriber: Sebastian\n\n\"The Art of Discipline\" Introductory to Advanced, Three Volumes 　　Subscriber<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">□□□□□</>"] = "\"Ladies' Aesthetics\" (edições nº 6 a 11, Omnibus Edition)　　Assinante: Christine\n\n\"The Jet-Black Butler\" Hardcover Collector's Edition 　　Assinante: Sebastian\n\n\"The Art of Discipline\" Introdutório ao Avançado, Três Volumes 　　Assinante <Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\"> □□□□□ </>",
  ["Book of Witches"] = "Livro das Bruxas",
  ["'Book of Witches', 'Ten Unsolved Mysteries of the Second Epoch'—there are always people dedicated to clearing the fog of mysticism. Is there anything you are interested in?"] = "'Livro das Bruxas', 'Dez Mistérios Não Resolvidos da Segunda Época' – sempre há pessoas dedicadas a dissipar a névoa do misticismo. Há algo em que você esteja interessado?",
  ["\"Learning to Read\"? If I knew how to read, would I still need to learn from this book? Seriously."] = "\"Aprendendo a Ler\"? Se eu soubesse ler, ainda precisaria aprender com este livro? Seriamente.",
  ["The \"Antigonus Family Notebook\" is in Riel Bieber's hands, but he has completely disappeared!"] = "O “Antigonus Family Notebook” está nas mãos de Riel Bieber, mas ele desapareceu completamente!",
  ["The \"Antigonus Family Notebook\" is in Riel Bieber's hands, Sealed Artifact 2-049 will lead us to find him."] = "O \"Antigonus Family Notebook\" está nas mãos de Riel Bieber, Sealed Artifact 2-049 nos levará a encontrá-lo.",
